  "question_type": "multiple_choice",
  "stem_markdown": "### 9. 过点 $(-1, -1)$ 且与曲线 $y = 3x^{3} + 2$ 相切的直线方程可能为（）\n\nA. $8x - y + 7 = 0$\n\nB. $9x - y + 8 = 0$\n\nC. $9x - 4y + 5 = 0$\n\nD. $8x - 3y + 5 = 0$",
  "stem_html": "<h3>9. 过点 $(-1, -1)$ 且与曲线 $y = 3x^{3} + 2$ 相切的直线方程可能为（）</h3>\n<p>A. $8x - y + 7 = 0$</p>\n<p>B. $9x - y + 8 = 0$</p>\n<p>C. $9x - 4y + 5 = 0$</p>\n<p>D. $8x - 3y + 5 = 0$</p>",
  "options": {
    "A": "$8x - y + 7 = 0$",
    "B": "$9x - y + 8 = 0$",
    "C": "$9x - 4y + 5 = 0$",
    "D": "$8x - 3y + 5 = 0$"
  },
  "answer": "BC",
  "solution_markdown": "### 9. BC\n\n**详解**设切点为 $(x_{0},3x_{0}^{3}+2)$ ，又 $y'=9x^{2}$ ，所以 $y'\\mid_{x=x_{0}}=9x_{0}^{2}$ 所以曲线 $y=3x^{3}+2$ 在点 $(x_{0},3x_{0}^{3}+2)$ 处的切线方程为 $y-(3x_{0}^{3}+2)=9x_{0}^{2}(x-x_{0})$ 所以 $-1-(3x_{0}^{3}+2)=9x_{0}^{2}(-1-x_{0})$ ，整理得 $(x_{0}+1)^{2}\\cdot(2x_{0}-1)=0$ ，解得 $x_{0}=-1$ 或 $x_{0}=\\frac{1}{2}$ ，即切线方程为9x-y+8=0或9x-4y+5=0.",
  "solution_html": "<h3>9. BC</h3>\n<p><strong>详解</strong>设切点为 $(x_{0},3x_{0}^{3}+2)$ ，又 $y'=9x^{2}$ ，所以 $y'\\mid_{x=x_{0}}=9x_{0}^{2}$ 所以曲线 $y=3x^{3}+2$ 在点 $(x_{0},3x_{0}^{3}+2)$ 处的切线方程为 $y-(3x_{0}^{3}+2)=9x_{0}^{2}(x-x_{0})$ 所以 $-1-(3x_{0}^{3}+2)=9x_{0}^{2}(-1-x_{0})$ ，整理得 $(x_{0}+1)^{2}\\cdot(2x_{0}-1)=0$ ，解得 $x_{0}=-1$ 或 $x_{0}=\\frac{1}{2}$ ，即切线方程为9x-y+8=0或9x-4y+5=0.</p>",
